# @DEVICE@

## Identity

| Field | Value |
| --- | --- |
| Target | `@TARGET@` |
| Device | @DEVICE@ |
| Platform | [Unisoc UMS9117](../../platforms/ums9117/README.md) |
| Boot | USB-loaded RAM bootstrap; initramfs root |

## Status

This target starts Linux in RAM without a boot screen. Linux has no display,
keypad, audio or Bluetooth support for this phone, and the phone is used through
the USB session. No feature has been tested on this exact phone.

Status terms and limits shared by every phone are defined in the
[target index](../README.md#status-and-common-limits).

